  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Border and Migration Management at Airports</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims for the improvement of inter-agency cooperation to better combat all forms of cross-border crime and irregular migration, and to facilitate the movement of trade and transportation. In line with the priorities, the project aims to strengthen operational capacity and inter-agency cooperation for more efficient border and migration management agencies. This will be achieved through the delivery of capacity development activities at selected Turkish airports, which will focus on enhancing passenger controls, and preventing cross-border crimes related to the airports. These efforts will contribute to the smooth and regular flow of passengers and more efficient border management in T&#xFC;rkiye, while focusing on EU standards and considering the specific situation of T&#xFC;rkiye and its strategic geographical location.</narrative>
  </description>
